| `input_adb_lookup(a.csv)`
```### Map source lookup to source name ###```
| eval source=case(source_lookup="a.csv", "a")
```### Split multivalue fields ###```
| foreach category, ip [eval <<FIELD>>=split(<<FIELD>>, "|")]
| search _key=*
```### Sort newest first (multivalue fields keep their most recent values) ###```
| sort 0 -_time
| stats values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(_time) as last_seen, latest(_time) as _time, list(category) as category, list(ip) as ip by _key
| adbmerge max_keys=25
| eval _key = md5(mvjoin(mvsort(asset), "::"))
| sort 0 -_time
| stats values(asset) as asset, values(source) as source, values(source_lookup) as source_lookup, max(last_seen) as last_seen, list(category) as category, list(ip) as ip by _key
```### De-duplicate multivalue fields (order is kept) ###```
| eval category = mvdedup(category), ip = mvdedup(ip)
```### Trim multivalue fields ###```
| eval category = mvindex(category,0,2), ip = mvindex(ip,0,9)
```### Output to KV store ###```
| table _key, asset, source, source_lookup, last_seen, category, ip
| outputlookup assetdb
